  "title": "Unsloppy Joes",
  "description": "The filling - kidney beans and lots of celery, carrots, green pepper tomatoes, and onions flavored with chili pepper and vinegar. When this is hot and savory, spoon into hollowed out Kaiser rolls and dig in.",
  "authors": [
    "Karen C. Greenlee"
